---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Common Scams in China & How to Avoid Them";
const description = "Don't let scammers ruin your China trip. Here are the most common tourist scams in China and exactly how to avoid them.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/tips/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Tips
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
  <header class="mb-12">
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🛡️ 中国旅游小贴士</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
      Common Scams in China<br class="hidden md:block" />& How to Avoid Them
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">不要让骗子毁了你的旅行。以下是需要注意的事项。</p>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
      <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
      <span>⏱️ 阅读6分钟</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-50 to-orange-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-red-800 leading-relaxed">
      <strong>绝大多数中国人都是诚实和乐于助人的。</strong> But like everywhere with tourism, some target tourists. The scams here target your <strong>不是你的恐惧。以下是需要注意的事项。</strong>, not your fear. If a stranger is <em>友好，想带你去某个地方——这是你的危险信号。</em> friendly and wants to take you somewhere — that's your red flag.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Table of Contents -->
  <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-3">
      <li><a href="#tea-house" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚕 2.假冒出租车和仪表</a></li>
      <li><a href="#fake-taxi" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎁 3.“免费赠品”然后付款</a></li>
      <li><a href="#free-gift" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛍️ 4.“我的朋友有商店”之旅</a></li>
      <li><a href="#shop-tour" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🆘 如果发生什么事该怎么办</a></li>
      <li><a href="#what-to-do" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">首先，让我诚实地说：</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
      Let me start by saying this honestly: <strong>但就像每个有旅游业的国家一样，有些人以游客为目标。这里的骗局针对的是你的</strong>
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">
      But like every country with tourism, some people target tourists. The scams here target your <strong>不是你的恐惧。以下是需要注意的事项。</strong>, not your fear. Here's what to watch for.
    </p>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Scam 1 -->
    <h2 id="tea-house" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🍵</span> 1. The Tea House or Art Studio Invitation
    </h2>

    <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">与茶馆骗局的设置相同——一个友好的陌生人搭讪你，并主动提出带你去他们的“朋友的商店”，在那里你可以买到茶、玉石或丝绸的“特价”。旅游景点的银饰和玉石店也陷入了同样的陷阱：他们的商品价格远远高于普通商业区的商店，真实性永远无法保证。</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
        A friendly young person approaches you near a major landmark. They say they're a student practicing English, or an art student who wants to show you a "traditional ceremony." After chatting, they take you to a nearby tea house or "studio." Staff serve you tea or demonstrate calligraphy, then hand you a bill for <strong>--气氛突然变得不友好。</strong> — and the atmosphere turns suddenly unfriendly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-3">不要接受街上陌生人提供的任何东西，即使是“免费的”</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
        <li>即使它们看起来是真实的，也不要跟着陌生人去第二个地方</li>
        <li>如果你最终陷入其中，请报警（110）——这些地方依赖恐吓，而不是法律权威</li>
        <li>💡 本地提示</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-12 not-prose">
      <p class="text-blue-900 font-semibold mb-2">真正想练习英语的学生只会在现场随便和你聊天。他们不会把你拖到任何陌生的地方，也不会要求你提供联系方式来保持联系。这种情况很少自然发生。</p>
      <p class="text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        Genuine students looking to practice English will only chat with you casually on the spot. They won't drag you off to any unfamiliar locations, nor will they ask for your contact information to keep in touch. That rarely happens naturally. <strong>如果有人主动接近你想交朋友，十有八九是骗局。</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Scam 2 -->
    <h2 id="fake-taxi" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🚕</span> 2. Fake Taxis and Rigged Meters
    </h2>

    <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">与茶馆骗局的设置相同——一个友好的陌生人搭讪你，并主动提出带你去他们的“朋友的商店”，在那里你可以买到茶、玉石或丝绸的“特价”。旅游景点的银饰和玉石店也陷入了同样的陷阱：他们的商品价格远远高于普通商业区的商店，真实性永远无法保证。</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
        At airports and train stations, a driver approaches you offering a ride. These unlicensed private vehicles, commonly known as "black cabs", often disguise themselves as taxis. Drivers usually charge a flat per-person rate, which is far higher than the fares of official licensed cars. What's worse, riding them comes with no safety guarantees.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mt-3">
        <strong>外面的寺庙、旅游市场、火车站附近</strong> Major airports, high-speed rail stations
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-3">不要接受街上陌生人提供的任何东西，即使是“免费的”</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
        <li><strong>（相当于中国的优步）——价格会提前显示、跟踪，你可以和朋友分享你的车</strong> (China's Uber equivalent) — prices are shown upfront, tracked, and you can share your ride with friends</li>
        <li>If you must take a taxi, <strong>在机场——忽略在外面等候的司机</strong> at the airport — ignore drivers waiting outside</li>
        <li>If the driver refuses to use the meter or quotes a price that seems too high, get out</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Scam 3 -->
    <h2 id="free-gift" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🎁</span> 3. The "Free Gift" Then Payment
    </h2>

    <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">与茶馆骗局的设置相同——一个友好的陌生人搭讪你，并主动提出带你去他们的“朋友的商店”，在那里你可以买到茶、玉石或丝绸的“特价”。旅游景点的银饰和玉石店也陷入了同样的陷阱：他们的商品价格远远高于普通商业区的商店，真实性永远无法保证。</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
        Someone offers you a "free" gift — a bracelet, a calligraphy scroll with your name, a Buddhist charm. The moment you accept it or let them put it on you, they demand payment. The "monk blessing" scam is the most common version of this.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mt-3">
        <strong>外面的寺庙、旅游市场、火车站附近</strong> Temples outside, tourist markets, near train stations
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-3">不要接受街上陌生人提供的任何东西，即使是“免费的”</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
        <li>如果有人不请自来地把手镯戴在你的手腕上，把它摘下来，马上还给你</li>
        <li>真正的佛教僧侣不会在街上卖祝福或护身符</li>
        <li>坚定地说“不，谢谢”然后走开总是有效的——他们不会跟着你的</li>
        <li>A firm "No, thank you" and walking away always works — they won't follow you</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Scam 4 -->
    <h2 id="shop-tour" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🛍️</span> 4. The "My Friend Has a Shop" Tour
    </h2>

    <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">与茶馆骗局的设置相同——一个友好的陌生人搭讪你，并主动提出带你去他们的“朋友的商店”，在那里你可以买到茶、玉石或丝绸的“特价”。旅游景点的银饰和玉石店也陷入了同样的陷阱：他们的商品价格远远高于普通商业区的商店，真实性永远无法保证。</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
        Same setup as the tea house scam — a friendly stranger chats you up and offers to take you to their "friend's shop" where you can get "special prices" on tea, jade, or silk. Tourist-site silver jewelry and jade stores fall into the same trap: their goods are priced far higher than shops in regular commercial districts, and authenticity can never be guaranteed.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mt-3">
        <strong>外面的寺庙、旅游市场、火车站附近</strong> Near every major tourist attraction
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-3">不要接受街上陌生人提供的任何东西，即使是“免费的”</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
        <li>从商业区的普通商店购买纪念品，而不是从街上接近你的人那里购买</li>
        <li>如果你想要优质的茶或玉石，去信誉良好的市场。</li>
        <li>如果你想要优质的茶叶或玉器，去信誉好的市场。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- What to Do -->
    <h2 id="what-to-do" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🆘</span> What to Do If Something Happens
    </h2>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <ol class="space-y-4">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="bg-red-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
          <div><strong>--警察紧急电话。在大城市，他们可以帮你联系一位说英语的官员</strong> — police emergency line. In major cities, they can connect you to an English-speaking officer</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="bg-red-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
          <div><strong>在安全的情况下，对人、商店或车辆进行检查</strong> of the person, shop, or vehicle if it's safe</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="bg-red-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
          <div><strong>--他们可以帮助向警方解释情况</strong> — they can help explain the situation to police</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="bg-red-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
          <div><strong>--这些人知道这个地区，你不知道。报告后继续前进</strong> — these people know the area, you don't. Report it and move on</div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />
  </div>

  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">VPN服务经常发生变化。没有单一的官方消息来源。在旅行前研究当前的建议。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>📚 相关指南</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
  <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <a href="/zh/tips/is-china-safe/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">不要让骗子毁了你的旅行</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">紧急电话号码和该怎么办</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/zh/tips/emergency-numbers/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">紧急电话号码和该怎么办</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">在需要之前先保存这些</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">支付宝、微信支付以及一切与金钱有关的东西</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">支付宝、微信支付以及一切与金钱有关的东西</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国的优步——安全又便宜</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">中国的优步——安全又便宜</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
</Layout>